方教收到陌生轉帳後這樣做1. 立即聯繫你的銀行或支付平台（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105908478947495936378420.jpeg/PnJ-ImMdtYhjBF6jq9Rhg0A--EVZ4utc4PfM7uD3zO4\"/><figcaption>警方教收到陌生轉帳後這樣做1. 立即聯繫你的銀行或支付平台（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方教收到陌生轉帳後這樣做2. 釐清資金性質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105908480990253056874165.jpeg/PjQbDGtupRPa12cSPfhPjx-yj6tW1BzgnIWHNZyFhzU\"/><figcaption>警方教收到陌生轉帳後這樣做2. 釐清資金性質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方教收到陌生轉帳後這樣做2. 釐清資金性質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105908483381137408091643.jpeg/zEy5KBwpZUf-UcafGhwYDJ1BxXK8BbD6SyLVyUsi1ck\"/><figcaption>警方教收到陌生轉帳後這樣做2. 釐清資金性質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105908485507780608436925.jpeg/7BWM3YLxdkyoOU027A5RmMG2mJws5Dn7EuRHphLkR6Y\"/><figcaption>如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105908475357040640206783.jpeg/nEx1fQujABF_2Q5m0Ri1ObPKkJYHAU-3RWPGukVjxro\"/><figcaption>如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105908477936668672926473.jpeg/7rn25Aj0Yj5TnqqO6YW_1qpCfZ9OhlpmHpEamB6RGpg\"/><figcaption>如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105908480331747328794523.jpeg/dMQtwfwLMDt_n3ZYcvjpmwNd9_LdlH-QN71g5je9YOY\"/><figcaption>如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>2026 日本退稅新制上路｜退稅多少幾 %、手續費、操作流程一次看！</p><p>【本文獲「JUKSY街星」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T08:18:57.578595+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1672,"images":27,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T08:00:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T10:57:42.753172+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-